all original failure/interruption receipts honest. Return actual pushedhead/remote conflictstatus/CI nextsignal and explicit checkout release; no                                    │\n merge/security-clearance/APIwatch/newfanout.                                                                                                                                                             │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n subagent steer                                                                                                                                                                                           │\n Steering queued for async run 04f972e0-8406-4a9e-b0c1-19225745a0ce (request 498c0db2-5dd1-4946-b8fc-18321afbcbf0). · 6 lines                                                                             │\n   Press ctrl+o for full output                                                                                                                                                                           │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n I relayed the parent’s slot reassignment. The worker is limited to the final auth, ref, staged-tree, size, and diff guards, then a normal non-force push only if those and the review still apply. No    │\n more tests will run; if the base or inputs changed, it must stop and request the slot rather than publish.                                                                                               │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Inspect subagent updates above. Answer pending supervisor requests within your authority. For completed work, read saved results and resume the already-authorized parent task, or report completion. If │\n approval is required, explicitly ask the user. Do not silently yield, rerun completed work, or infer new authorization.                                                                                  │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n✓ read /tmp/cor-2137/publication-receipt.md                                                                                                                                                               │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n subagent status                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Status target: run 04f972e0-8406-4a9e-b0c1-19225745a0ce · 19 lines                                                                                                                                       │\n   Press ctrl+o for full output                                                                                                                                                                           │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n✓ bash git status --short --branch; git rev-parse HEAD; git rev-parse -q --verify MERGE_HEAD || true; git ls-remote origin refs/heads/dependabot/go_modules/github.com/go-git/go-billy/v6-6.0.0-beta.1    │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Published the conflict repair as commit 64b9000ba5dc7e36eb784e88792eeadb7acf65d6 with a normal, non-force push. The remote head matches, and the checkout is clean. The latest-main diff is limited to   │\n go.mod and go.sum; the independent review found no issues.                                                                                                                                               │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n The documented local gates passed on the final candidate: lint, plain tests, race tests, cgo tests, phase1 tests, benchmarks, and build-all. The earlier full-check failure and interrupted runs remain  │\n recorded as such; the focused lock test passed but did not establish the earlier failure’s root cause.                                                                                                   │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Current evidence says the change is mergeable but blocked; required CI/review results are still the next signal. This is not a merge-readiness claim. Trail 276 — current Trail state was not refreshed. │\n The worker released the checkout and heavy-test slot; no merge, approval, Linear change, or API watch was performed.                                                                                     │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Parent-owned POST-MERGE GATE PASSED. Direct GitHub confirms actual merge d713794e5e111ff7fb3dd3e8d3ec6f30fd86347a on defaultmain; observed branchhead d713. Both protection and rules inventory sources  │\n fetched successfully, complete18 required contexts/app IDs matched actual-merge check IDs/URLs/terminalsuccess and main workflow-run identities. Saved verified receipt                                  │\n /Users/alex/.local/state/herdr/orchestrations/dependency-followups-20261015/postmerge-361/success-receipt.json. Original parent review_monitor361 produced post_merge_success; this is the same          │\n post-merge watch identity, not a new watch. You are authorized ONLY final repository-specific cleanup in your ownedwQ5 checkout, not worktree removal or Linear mutation. Stop/reconcile only your owned │\n worker/reviewer/test resources, preserve prior failure/diagnostic/publication/session receipts; archive only clearly-owned runtime scratch if needed, leave unknown/user changes untouched. Do NOT touch │\n other worktrees or kill global Go processes: setup-go actively verifying. Verify actual Trail status and locally publish that observed status with owner context; never infer Trailstatus from PR merge. │\n Return cleanup receipt with exact clean/index/untracked state, owned resources terminal or intentionally retained, branch/session/worktree occupancy and remaining cleanup recipe. Explicitly release    │\n checkout and report whether ready for parent non-force Herdr removal; do not remove it yourself. No force/sudo/globaltool/config writes/wrappers, no code/test/PR changes or newfanout. Parent alone     │\n removes workspace and marksDone after validating receipt.                                                                                                                                                │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n✓ read ~/.claude/skills/herdr/SKILL.md\n\n✓ read ~/.claude/skills/capturing-agent-knowledge/SKILL.md\n\n✓ bash entire agent-help trail; entire trail --help; entire session current\n\n✓ bash pwd; git status --short --branch; git rev-parse HEAD; git status --porcelain=v1; git worktree list --porcelain | rg -A4 -B1 'alex-conflict-go-bill