                                                                           │\n✓ read /tmp/setup-go-repair.FRIWIB/refresh-d713794e5e111ff7fb3dd3e8d3ec6f30fd86347a/README.md                                                                                                             │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n subagent resume                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n [fresh] Revived async subagent from bb675c92-f504-497a-95b5-ee4e0f71c54e. · 10 lines                                                                                                                     │\n   Press ctrl+o for full output                                                                                                                                                                           │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n The fresh GraphQL observation resolved the discrepancy: the live default branch and PR baseRef.target both point to d713794e; only the scalar baseRefOid remains stale. I resumed the same worker to     │\n stage the preserved candidate, create the normal merge commit, perform a fresh auth check, and conditionally push. No commit or push has been confirmed yet.                                             │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Parent reconciled the base-reference discrepancy independently. SAME GitHub GraphQL response: repository.defaultBranchRef main target=d713794e5e111ff7fb3dd3e8d3ec6f30fd86347a AND                       │\n PR356.baseRef.target.oid=d713, baseRefName=main, base/head repositories both entireio/entire-brain. GitHub REST git/ref/heads/main AND origin gitlsremote also both=d713. Separate PR.baseRefOid         │\n remainsaa4b91b48af9c62ce12ea5a09883f3c61ece2be7; direct GitHub compare aa4...d713 is ahead86/behind0 with merge-baseaa4, so that differing field is an OLD ANCESTOR, not conflicting evidence of a       │\n different live branch tip. This is evidence-based reconciliation, not permission to guess stale data. Do not invent equality of PR.baseRefOid with live refs as a new publication requirement.           │\n Actual guard: current authoritative live defaultref must be ancestor of final NORMAL merge commit, original bot remotehead must be unchanged, candidate/source/review/gates must match                   │\n verified521893ef0cfb1f5d9e272e3d28cd38d1157a77d5 and qualified receipts. Confirm normal ancestry containing both bothead andd713, not merely tree equality. Fresh literalghauthstatus plus live          │\n repository/ref/head/size/diff/index guards, then already-authorized normal commit and non-force push existing botbranch if passing. Use SAME latest workerbb675c92-f504-497a-95b5-ee4e0f71c54e           │\n status/steer or resume as appropriate; no new reviewer/workspace or native test reruns for this reconciled API-field issue. If ACTUAL live main advances beyond d713 or true input/scope mismatch        │\n emerges, stop and report it under existing budget. Preserve all receipts and conflicting raw field values. Return actual remotehead/conflictstatus/CI signal and checkout/slot release; no merge/security│\n approval/globalchanges/force/newPR.                                                                                                                                                                      │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n subagent status                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Status target: run c5b4dc72-4242-4463-8a63-a5260ee83a06 · 19 lines                                                                                                                                       │\n   Press ctrl+o for full output                                                                                                                                                                           │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                    