{"type":"message","id":"c218db66","parentId":"1c1d410a","timestamp":"2026-10-16T00:23:14.365Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_e95702188c44484fa27f139b944c4e69|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad16e686d3c81919fe09191a86cee75","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"nameWithOwner\": \"entireio/entire-brain\",\n  \"defaultBranchRef\": {\n    \"name\": \"main\",\n    \"target\": {\n      \"oid\": \"8724085d27b91fd02353f3a4c275709bb21476b1\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"setup\": {\n    \"state\": \"MERGED\",\n    \"mergedAt\": \"2026-10-15T23:55:03Z\",\n    \"mergeCommit\": {\n      \"oid\": \"8724085d27b91fd02353f3a4c275709bb21476b1\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"id\": 116742130239,\n  \"name\": \"test-cgo (macos-latest)\",\n  \"head_sha\": \"8724085d27b91fd02353f3a4c275709bb21476b1\",\n  \"status\": \"completed\",\n  \"conclusion\": \"success\",\n  \"details_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/actions/runs/38826422358/job/116742130239\",\n  \"check_suite_id\": 105222191193,\n  \"app_id\": 15368\n}\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": 38826422358,\n    \"name\": \"test\",\n    \"run_attempt\": 2,\n    \"event\": \"push\",\n    \"head_sha\": \"8724085d27b91fd02353f3a4c275709bb21476b1\",\n    \"head_branch\": \"main\",\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"conclusion\": \"success\",\n    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/actions/runs/38826422358\"\n  }\n]\n"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":3337,"timestamp":1792110194365}}
{"type":"message","id":"aca55da8","parentId":"c218db66","timestamp":"2026-10-16T00:23:14.365Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_87b88a12c8f843cb9ea4a695ab20642f|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad16e6ec9a88191a8dc1f369c9571f8","toolName":"mcp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found 1 tool matching \"list_issue_labels\":\n\nlinear_list_issue_labels\n  List available issue labels in a Linear workspace or team. A retired label carries `retiredAt` and cannot be applied to new issues.\n\n  Parameters:\n    limit (number) - Maximum number of results to return per page [maximum: 250] [default: 50]\n    cursor (string) - Omit for the first page. To continue, pass the previous response's cursor when hasNextPage is true\n    orderBy (enum: \"createdAt\", \"updatedAt\") - Timestamp to sort results by: creation time or last update time [default: \"updatedAt\"]\n    name (string) - Filter by name\n    team (string) - Team name or ID\n    includeArchived (boolean) - Include archived items [default: false]\n    includeGroups (boolean) - Include label groups in the results, marked with `isGroup`. A group cannot be applied directly; retiring or restoring one cascades to its child labels [default: false]"}],"details":{"mode":"search","matches":[{"server":"linear","tool":"linear_list_issue_labels"}],"count":1,"query":"list_issue_labels"},"isError":false,"durationMs":1,"timestamp":1792110194365}}
{"type":"message","id":"e51604cc","parentId":"aca55da8","timestamp":"2026-10-16T00:23:14.365Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b46d107822ca415bb57d6e76240673b0|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad16e6ec9a88191a808a23a8b600103","toolName":"mcp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"linear_save_issue\nServer: linear\n\nCreate or update a Linear issue. If `id` is provided, updates the existing issue; otherwise creates a new one. When creating, `team` is required, and `title` is required unless `template` is set. Note: use `assignee` (not `assigneeId`) to set the assignee — it accepts a user ID, name, email, or \"me\".\n\nParameters:\n  id (string) - Only for updating an existing issue. Pass the issue ID or identifier (e.g., LIN-123). Do NOT pass this parameter when creating a new issue.\n  title (string) - Issue title (required when creating, unless template is set)\n  description (string) - Content as Markdown. Do not escape the string — use literal newlines and special characters, not escape sequences. To mention a user, use @displayName (e.g., @johndoe)\n  patch (array) - Partial edits applied to the current content, in order and atomically (one failing operation aborts the whole save). Every anchor string must match the current content exactly once. Only valid on update, in place of the full content/description field [minItems: 1] [maxItems: 50]\n    items\n      oneOf:\n        - object\n          op (const \"replace\") *required*\n          old_string (string) *required* - Exact text to replace. Must match the current content exactly once [minLength: 1]\n          new_string (string) *required* - Replacement text. Empty string deletes the match\n          replace_all (boolean) - Replace every occurrence instead of requiring a unique match\n        - object\n          op (const \"insert_before\") *required*\n          anchor (string) *required* - Exact text to insert before. Must match the current content exactly once [minLength: 1]\n          text (string) *required* - Text to insert directly before the anchor. Include separators (e.g. \"\\n\\n\") [minLength: 1]\n        - object\n          op (const \"insert_after\") *required*\n          anchor (string) *required* - Exact text to insert after. Must match the current content exactly once [minLength: 1]\n          text (string) *required* - Text to insert directly after the anchor. Include separators (e.g. \"\\n\\n\") [minLength: 1]\n        - object\n          op (const \"prepend\") *required*\n          text (string) *required* - Text to insert at the very start of the content [minLength: 1]\n        - object\n          op (const \"append\") *required*\n          text (string) *required* - Text to insert at the very end of the content [minLength: 1]\n        - object\n          op (const \"replace_range\") *required*\n          from (string) *required* - Exact text where the range starts (inclusive). Must match exactly once [minLength: 1]\n          to (string) *required* - Exact text where the range ends (exclusive, stays in place). Must match exactly once after `from` [minLength: 1]\n          new_string (string) *required* - Text replacing the range. Empty string deletes it\n  team (string) - Team name or ID (required when creating)\n  template (string) - Template name or ID. Applied on create only. The template fills in the content, fields, and sub-issues server-side. A `description` replaces the template body rather than merging with it, but an empty `description` keeps the template body. Labels merge with the template's own\n  cycle (string | null) - Cycle name, number, or ID. Null to remove\n  milestone (string) - Milestone name or ID\n  priority (number) - 0=None, 1=Urgent, 2=High, 3=Medium, 4=Low\n  project (string | null) - Project name, ID, identifier (e.g., P-ENG-123), or slug. Null to remove\n  state (string) - State type, name, or ID\n  assignee (string | null) - User ID, name, email, or \"me\". Null to remove\n  delegate (string | null) - Agent name or ID. When the user asks to delegate to \"Linear\" or \"the Linear agent\", this refers to the \"Linear\" app user specifically. Null to remove\n  labels (array) - Label names or IDs as a JSON array of strings (e.g. [\"Bug\", \"Urgent\"]). Replaces the full label set; existing labels not included are removed. Omit to leave labels unchanged. Cannot be combined with addLabels/removeLabels; prefer those for incremental changes\n    items (string)\n  addLabels (array) - Label names or IDs as a JSON array of strings (e.g. [\"Bug\", \"Urgent\"]) to add. Append-only; existing labels are never removed. Cannot be combined with a team change\n    items (string)\n  removeLabels (array) - Label names or IDs as a JSON array of strings (e.g. [\"Bug\", \"Urgent\"]) to remove. Only valid when updating an existing issue. Cannot be combined with a team change\n    items (string)\n  dueDate (string | null) - Due date (ISO format). On update, pass null to remove the due date\n  slaBreachesAt - ISO-8601 timestamp when the SLA will breach. On update, pass null to remove the SLA\n    anyOf:\n      - string [format: \"date-time\"] [pattern: \"^(?:(?:\\\\d\\\\d[2468][048]|\\\\d\\\\d[13579][26]|\\\\d\\\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\\\d:[0-5]\\\\d(?:\\\\.\\\\d+)?(?:Z|([+-](?:[01]\\\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\\\d)))$\"]\n      - null\n  slaType - SLA day counting type: \"all\" or \"onlyBusinessDays\". Only use with slaBreachesAt; null means unset\n    anyOf:\n      - enum: \"all\", \"onlyBusinessDays\"\n      - null\n  parentId (string | null) - Parent issue ID or identifier (e.g., LIN-123). Null to remove\n  estimate (number | null) - Issue estimate value. On create, pass null or omit for no estimate. On update, pass null to clear the estimate; omitting leaves it unchanged. 0 is a real estimate only on teams that allow zero estimates.\n  links (array) - Link attachments to add [{url, title}]. Append-only; existing links are never removed\n    items (object)\n      url (string) *required* [format: \"uri\"]\n      title (string) *required* [minLength: 1]\n  setReleases (array) - Replace all releases on the issue with these. Cannot be combined with addReleases/removeReleases\n    items (string)\n  addReleases (array) - Release IDs or slugs to add. Append-only; existing releases are never removed\n    items (string)\n  removeReleases (array) - Release IDs or slugs to remove. Only valid when updating an existing issue\n    items (string)\n  blocks (array) - Issue IDs/identifiers this blocks. Append-only; existing relations are never removed\n    items (string)\n  blockedBy (array) - Issue IDs/identifiers blocking this. Append-only; existing relations are never removed\n    items (string)\n  relatedTo (array) - Related issue IDs/identifiers. Append-only; existing relations are never removed\n    items (string)\n  duplicateOf (string | null) - Duplicate of issue ID/identifier. Null to remove\n  removeBlocks (array) - Issue IDs/identifiers to stop blocking\n    items (string)\n  removeBlockedBy (array) - Issue IDs/identifiers to remove as blockers of this issue\n    items (string)\n  removeRelatedTo (array) - Related issue IDs/identifiers to remove\n    items (string)"}],"details":{"mode":"describe","tool":{"name":"linear_save_issue","originalName":"save_issue","description":"Create or update a Linear issue. If `id` is provided, updates the existing issue; otherwise creates a new one. When creating, `team` is required, and `title` is required unless `template` is set. Note: use `assignee` (not `assigneeId`) to set the assignee — it accepts a user ID, name, email, or \"me\".","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"description":"Only for updating an existing issue. Pass the issue ID or identifier (e.g., LIN-123). Do NOT pass this parameter when creating a new issue.","type":"string"},"title":{"description":"Issue title (required when creating, unless template is set)","type":"string"},"description":{"description":"Content as Markdown. Do not escape the string — use literal newlines and special characters, not escape sequences. To mention a user, use @displayName (e.g., @johndoe)","type":"string"},"patch":{"description":"Partial edits applied to the current content, in order and atomically (one failing operation aborts the whole save). Every anchor string must match the current content exactly once. Only valid on update, in place of the full content/description field","minItems":1,"maxItems":50,"type":"array","items":{"oneOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"op":{"type":"string","const":"replace"},"old_string":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Exact text to replace. Must match the current content exactly once"},"new_string":{"type":"string","description":"Replacement text. Empty string deletes the match"},"replace_all":{"description":"Replace every occurrence instead of requiring a unique match","type":"boolean"}},"required":["op","old_string","new_string"]},{"type":"object","properties":{"op":{"type":"string","const":"insert_before"},"anchor":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Exact text to insert before. Must match the current content exactly once"},"text":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Text to insert directly before the anchor. Include separators (e.g. \"\\n\\n\")"}},"required":["op","anchor","text"]},{"type":"object","properties":{"op":{"type":"string","const":"insert_after"},"anchor":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Exact text to insert after. Must match the current content exactly once"},"text":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Text to insert directly after the anchor. Include separators (e.g. \"\\n\\n\")"}},"required":["op","anchor","text"]},{"type":"object","properties":{"op":{"type":"string","const":"prepend"},"text":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Text to insert at the very start of the content"}},"required":["op","text"]},{"type":"object","properties":{"op":{"type":"string","const":"append"},"text":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Text to insert at the very end of the content"}},"required":["op","text"]},{"type":"object","properties":{"op":{"type":"string","const":"replace_range"},"from":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Exact text where the range starts (inclusive). Must match exactly once"},"to":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"Exact text where the range ends (exclusive, stays in place). Must match exactly once after `from`"},"new_string":{"type":"string","description":"Text replacing the range. Empty string deletes it"}},"required":["op","from","to","new_string"]}]}},"team":{"description":"Team name or ID (required when creating)","type":"string"},"template":{"description":"Template name or ID. Applied on create only. The template fills in the content, fields, and sub-issues server-side. A `description` replaces the template body rather than merging with it, but an empty `description` keeps the template body. Labels merge with the template's own","type":"string"},"cycle":{"description":"Cycle name, number, or ID. Null to remove","type":["string","null"]},"milestone":{"description":"Milestone name or ID","type":"string"},"priority":{"description":"0=None, 1=Urgent, 2=High, 3=Medium, 4=Low","type":"number"},"project":{"description":"Project name, ID, identifier (e.g., P-ENG-123), or slug. Null to remove","type":["string","null"]},"state":{"description":"State type, name, or ID","type":"string"},"assignee":{"description":"User ID, name, email, or \"me\". Null to remove","type":["string","null"]},"delegate":{"description":"Agent name or ID. When the user asks to delegate to \"Linear\" or \"the Linear agent\", this refers to the \"Linear\" app user specifically. Null to remove","type":["string","null"]},"labels":{"description":"Label names or IDs as a JSON array of strings (e.g. [\"Bug\", \"Urgent\"]). Replaces the full label set; existing labels not included are removed. Omit to leave labels unchanged. Cannot be combined with addLabels/removeLabels; prefer those for incremental changes","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"addLabels":{"description":"Label names or IDs as a JSON array of strings (e.g. [\"Bug\", \"Urgent\"]) to add. Append-only; existing labels are never removed. Cannot be combined with a team change","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"removeLabels":{"description":"Label names or IDs as a JSON array of strings (e.g. [\"Bug\", \"Urgent\"]) to remove. Only valid when updating an existing issue. Cannot be combined with a team change","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"dueDate":{"description":"Due date (ISO format). On update, pass null to remove the due date","type":["string","null"]},"slaBreachesAt":{"description":"ISO-8601 timestamp when the SLA will breach. On update, pass null to remove the SLA","anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"date-time","pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d:[0-5]\\d(?:\\.\\d+)?(?:Z|([+-](?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d)))$"},{"type":"null"}]},"slaType":{"description":"SLA day counting type: \"all\" or \"onlyBusinessDays\". Only use with slaBreachesAt; null means unset","anyOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["all","onlyBusinessDays"]},{"type":"null"}]},"parentId":{"description":"Parent issue ID or identifier (e.g., LIN-123). Null to remove","type":["string","null"]},"estimate":{"description":"Issue estimate value. On create, pass null or omit for no estimate. On update, pass null to clear the estimate; omitting leaves it unchanged. 0 is a real estimate only on teams that allow zero estimates.","type":["number","null"]},"links":{"description":"Link attachments to add [{url, title}]. Append-only; existing links are never removed","type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"url":{"type":"string","format":"uri"},"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"required":["url","title"]}},"setReleases":{"description":"Replace all releases on the issue with these. Cannot be combined with addReleases/removeReleases","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"addReleases":{"description":"Release IDs or slugs to add. Append-only; existing releases are never removed","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"removeReleases":{"description":"Release IDs or slugs to remove. Only valid when updating an existing issue","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"blocks":{"description":"Issue IDs/identifiers this blocks. Append-only; existing relations are never removed","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"blockedBy":{"description":"Issue IDs/identifiers blocking this. Append-only; existing relations are never removed","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"relatedTo":{"description":"Related issue IDs/identifiers. Append-only; existing relations are never removed","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"duplicateOf":{"description":"Duplicate of issue ID/identifier. Null to remove","type":["string","null"]},"removeBlocks":{"description":"Issue IDs/identifiers to stop blocking","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"removeBlockedBy":{"description":"Issue IDs/identifiers to remove as blockers of this issue","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"removeRelatedTo":{"description":"Related issue IDs/identifiers to remove","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false}},"server":"linear"},"isError":false,"durationMs":1,"timestamp":1792110194365}}
