{"type":"message","id":"1fab12c8","parentId":"b3752494","timestamp":"2026-10-16T00:25:22.522Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_56311b3f3c7f4c458cf7bc1d55a211c0|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad16ee86bf48191942b3a2cde1e3ff1","name":"mcp","arguments":{"tool":"linear_save_issue","args":{"team":"Core","title":"Capture diagnostic context for intermittent Git fixture HEAD parse failures","description":"The main-branch macOS CGO test job failed on merge commit 8724085d27b91fd02353f3a4c275709bb21476b1 during Git fixture setup, before application assertions: git commit --allow-empty exited 128 with fatal: could not parse HEAD.\n\nThe bounded investigation identified the immediate failing operation but not the underlying HEAD/ref/object/environment condition. One focused local macOS/arm64 race+CGO reproduction passed. One controlled job-only diagnostic repeat with debug logging on the exact same commit also passed without code changes. All 18 required checks on that merge commit are now successful. This is CI recovery, not proof that the underlying defect was fixed, nor evidence that setup-go v7 caused it.\n\nEvidence:\n- Original failed job: https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/actions/runs/38826422358/job/116734834928\n- Successful same-SHA diagnostic repeat: https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/actions/runs/38826422358/job/116742130239\n- Related merged Trail: https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271\n\nBounded follow-up: investigate the existing fixture setup path and add minimal sanitized failure-only reporting sufficient to inspect HEAD/ref/object existence and relevant non-secret Git environment when the operation fails again. Preserve the original failure and exit semantics. Add focused validation for diagnostic behavior and redaction. Do not dump credentials, full environment/configuration, or tokens; do not weaken tests, add automatic retry loops, change production pins/receipts, or attribute a root cause without evidence. No implementation has been started by this issue.","project":"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75","milestone":"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556","state":"Backlog","priority":3,"labels":["a737f1c8-6877-4b71-9010-225de8d22b87"],"assignee":"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c","relatedTo":["COR-2138"],"links":[{"url":"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271","title":"Merged dependency update — Trail 271"},{"url":"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/actions/runs/38826422358/job/116734834928","title":"Original macOS CGO fixture setup failure"},{"url":"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/actions/runs/38826422358/job/116742130239","title":"Successful same-commit diagnostic repeat"}]}}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","usage":{"input":3033,"output":643,"cacheRead":504576,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":508252,"cost":{"input":0.012131999999999999,"output":0.009645,"cacheRead":0.10091520000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.1226922}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792110308922,"responseId":"resp_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad16ee647488191aab4a39967776a6a","rawStopReason":"completed","durationMs":13599,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}}
