"call_d13e64dd28c4449c81b145df070ad3bd|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad16f793f308191af3c52d1b08b4ad9","name":"mcp","arguments":{"tool":"linear_save_issue","args":{"team":"Core","title":"Assess setup-go v7 bundled XML-parser advisory and workflow exposure","description":"Retain the unresolved security concern separately from completed mechanical conflict repair and recovered main CI.\n\nThe prior exact-target review observed actions/setup-go v7.0.0 / v7 at b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e with fast-xml-parser 5.9.3 in its upstream runtime inventory and bundle. GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q was active HIGH, affecting >=5.9.3,<5.10.1 with fix at 5.10.1. Presence in the bundle is not proof of attacker-controlled workflow reachability. The broader bounded audit did not establish overall security clearance. Refresh all current facts before choosing remediation.\n\nThe workflow update was subsequently merged (Trail 271); passing native or CI checks did not resolve this advisory. The separate macOS CGO Git-fixture failure recovered on one unchanged-commit diagnostic repeat and has no established causal connection to this concern.\n\nBounded acceptance:\n- Resolve the currently used v7 tag to its exact upstream commit and verify release/provenance.\n- Check current authoritative GitHub/OSV advisory status and actual shipped runtime package versions, excluding dev-only inventory.\n- Assess the relevant workflow input, credential and dataflow exposure without assuming that contents:read, lack of product-runtime shipping, or advisory counts alone prove safety/exploitability.\n- If affected, propose an unambiguously compatible official patched release or another evidence-supported remediation through a separate reviewed slice. Do not rewrite upstream bundles or alter admin/security policy, historical receipts or production benchmark pins.\n- Record explicit evidence-backed disposition; do not inherit a security clearance from successful CI.\n\nSources: https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q and https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q. Related merged Trail: https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271. No implementation is started by this issue.","project":"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75","milestone":"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556","state":"Backlog","priority":2,"labels":["Security"],"assignee":"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c","relatedTo":["COR-2138"],"links":[{"url":"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271","title":"Merged setup-go workflow update — Trail 271"},{"url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q","title":"Authoritative XML-parser advisory"}]}}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","usage":{"input":353,"output":732,"cacheRead":514048,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":73,"totalTokens":515133,"cost":{"input":0.0014119999999999998,"output":0.01098,"cacheRead":0.10280960000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.11520160000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792110448606,"responseId":"resp_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad16f7207e48191a608100ec1c19b81","rawStopReason":"completed","durationMs":19443,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}}
{"type":"message","id":"9ca19722","parentId":"1c5a015f","timestamp":"2026-10-16T00:27:51.111Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d13e64dd28c4449c81b145df070ad3bd|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad16f793f308191af3c52d1b08b4ad9","toolName":"mcp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2145\",\"uuid\":\"dd6fe94b-6ae8-46b6-afd1-43bfa0085e5f\",\"title\":\"Assess setup-go v7 bundled XML-parser advisory and workflow exposure\",\"description\":\"Retain the unresolved security concern separately from completed mechanical conflict repair and recovered main CI.\\n\\nThe prior exact-target review observed actions/setup-go v7.0.0 / v7 at b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e with fast-xml-parser 5.9.3 in its upstream runtime inventory and bundle. GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q was active HIGH, affecting >=5.9.3,<5.10.1 with fix at 5.10.1. Presence in the bundle is not proof of attacker-controlled workflow reachability. The broader bounded audit did not establish overall security clearance. Refresh all current facts before choosing remediation.\\n\\nThe workflow update was subsequently merged (Trail 271); passing native or CI checks did not resolve this advisory. The separate macOS CGO Git-fixture failure recovered on one unchanged-commit diagnostic repeat and has no established causal connection to this concern.\\n\\nBounded acceptance:\\n\\n* Resolve the currently used v7 tag to its exact upstream commit and verify release/provenance.\\n* Check current authoritative GitHub/OSV advisory status and actual shipped runtime package versions, excluding dev-only inventory.\\n* Assess the relevant workflow input, credential and dataflow exposure without assuming that contents:read, lack of product-runtime shipping, or advisory counts alone prove safety/exploitability.\\n* If affected, propose an unambiguously compatible official patched release or another evidence-supported remediation through a separate reviewed slice. Do not rewrite upstream bundles or alter admin/security policy, historical receipts or production benchmark pins.\\n* Record explicit evidence-backed disposition; do not inherit a security clearance from successful CI.\\n\\nSources: [https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>) and [https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>). Related merged Trail: [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271>). No implementation is started by this issue.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2145/assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow-exposure\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2145-assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:27:49.124Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:27:49.124Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"5c86a822-8ef3-49ad-bba6-9c82e2b3bd21\",\"title\":\"Authoritative XML-parser advisory\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q\"},{\"id\":\"87173ad1-2079-4955-87e5-64d445819dee\",\"title\":\"Merged setup-go workflow update — Trail 271\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}],"details":{"mode":"call","mcpResult":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2145\",\"uuid\":\"dd6fe94b-6ae8-46b6-afd1-43bfa0085e5f\",\"title\":\"Assess setup-go v7 bundled XML-parser advisory and workflow exposure\",\"description\":\"Retain the unresolved security concern separately from completed mechanical conflict repair and recovered main CI.\\n\\nThe prior exact-target review observed actions/setup-go v7.0.0 / v7 at b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e with fast-xml-parser 5.9.3 in its upstream runtime inventory and bundle. GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q was active HIGH, affecting >=5.9.3,<5.10.1 with fix at 5.10.1. Presence in the bundle is not proof of attacker-controlled workflow reachability. The broader bounded audit did not establish overall security clearance. Refresh all current facts before choosing remediation.\\n\\nThe workflow update was subsequently merged (Trail 271); passing native or CI checks did not resolve this advisory. The separate macOS CGO Git-fixture failure recovered on one unchanged-commit diagnostic repeat and has no established causal connection to this concern.\\n\\nBounded acceptance:\\n\\n* Resolve the currently used v7 tag to its exact upstream commit and verify release/provenance.\\n* Check current authoritative GitHub/OSV advisory status and actual shipped runtime package versions, excluding dev-only inventory.\\n* Assess the relevant workflow input, credential and dataflow exposure without assuming that contents:read, lack of product-runtime shipping, or advisory counts alone prove safety/exploitability.\\n* If affected, propose an unambiguously compatible official patched release or another evidence-supported remediation through a separate reviewed slice. Do not rewrite upstream bundles or alter admin/security policy, historical receipts or production benchmark pins.\\n* Record explicit evidence-backed disposition; do not inherit a security clearance from successful CI.\\n\\nSources: [https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>) and [https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>). Related merged Trail: [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271>). No implementation is started by this issue.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2145/assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow-exposure\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2145-assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:27:49.124Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:27:49.124Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"5c86a822-8ef3-49ad-bba6-9c82e2b3bd21\",\"title\":\"Authoritative XML-parser advisory\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q\"},{\"id\":\"87173ad1-2079-4955-87e5-64d445819dee\",\"title\":\"Merged setup-go workflow update — Trail 271\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\"