re original cleanup; success on newercommit alone is not that receipt. Escalate apparently unrelated failures explicitly, never exclude.                                             │\n Heavy slot available to this lane for needed focused CGO repro; no other owned heavy lane active. No global tool/config writes, package installs, executablewrappers/symlinks; runtime guard             │\n beforePython, genuine interpreter directly, no actionbundle execution onhost or secrets dumps. gh explicit -R entireio/entire-brain. Do not use reviewer/anotherCLI as fallback if Pi lane fails. Parent │\n owns check inventory/merge detection/CI watch, Linear, cleanup and final conclusion. Return diagnosis and concrete next signal promptly; no log polling forever.                                         │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n✓ read ~/.claude/plugins/cache/claude-plugins-official/superpowers/6.4.1/skills/systematic-debugging/SKILL.md                                                                                             │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n✓ read ~/.claude/plugins/cache/claude-plugins-official/superpowers/6.4.1/skills/systematic-debugging/SKILL.md                                                                                             │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n subagent status                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Status target: run c5b4dc72-4242-4463-8a63-a5260ee83a06 · 19 lines                                                                                                                                       │\n   Press ctrl+o for full output                                                                                                                                                                           │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n subagent resume                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n [fresh] Revived async subagent from c5b4dc72-4242-4463-8a63-a5260ee83a06. · 10 lines                                                                                                                     │\n   Press ctrl+o for full output                                                                                                                                                                           │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n I resumed the existing worker for a read-only root-cause investigation of the exact failed cgo job. It will compare the failed run with the passing d713 evidence and inspect the relevant logs; only a  │\n focused reproduction is authorized. No fix, rerun, or cleanup is underway.                                                                                                                               │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Inspect subagent updates above. Answer pending supervisor requests within your authority. For completed work, read saved results and resume the already-authorized parent task, or report completion. If │\n approval is required, explicitly ask the user. Do not silently yield, rerun completed work, or infer new authorization.                                                                                  │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                          