are at /tmp/setup-go-conflict-cleanup-20261016/cleanup-receipt.txt. Diagnostic, reproduction, CI,\n publication, and session receipts were retained. No source edits, branch/worktree removal, Linear changes, or additional commit/push occurred.\n\n Trail 271 was directly observed merged at 2026-10-16T00:27:54Z, and local footer state was published. The upstream action security concern remains separate and unresolved.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n~/.herdr/worktrees/entire-brain/alex-conflict-setup-go (dependabot/github_actions/actions/setup-go-7)\n↑923k ↓103k R34M CH99.2% $0.596 (sub) 29.4%/1.1M (auto)                                                                                                                  (openai-codex) gpt-6-luna • medium\ncompact @ 75% 🔌 MCP: 5 servers enabled\n"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":638,"timestamp":1792110677119}}
