{"type":"message","id":"3792c638","parentId":"67b95226","timestamp":"2026-10-16T00:32:20.273Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_68e2fa3ceac849a09544aeec66e85f95|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad17093d2bc8191b9a4009653015f97","name":"mcp","arguments":{"tool":"linear_save_issue","args":{"id":"COR-2138","state":"Done"}}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","usage":{"input":807,"output":33,"cacheRead":527232,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":528072,"cost":{"input":0.003228,"output":0.000495,"cacheRead":0.10544640000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.10916940000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792110733766,"responseId":"resp_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad1708fc2548191a8c80043cd85981d","rawStopReason":"completed","durationMs":6507,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}}
{"type":"message","id":"aba26fec","parentId":"3792c638","timestamp":"2026-10-16T00:32:22.588Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_68e2fa3ceac849a09544aeec66e85f95|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad17093d2bc8191b9a4009653015f97","toolName":"mcp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2138\",\"uuid\":\"aa77932a-a36f-4709-9d78-0221aae0d1f8\",\"title\":\"entire-brain: resolve setup-go dependency-update merge conflicts\",\"description\":\"Resolve only the mechanical workflow conflicts for the existing setup-go major update linked to [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271>). User explicitly authorized parallel conflict-repair workers; do not merge any update.\\n\\nPreserve current main's toolchain/security fixes, workflow permissions, runners and unrelated actions. Keep conflict resolution within the original update's intended scope; no new privileges, source refactor, test/CI weakening, provenance changes, force-push or replacement PR. Stop on semantic uncertainty rather than guessing.\\n\\nCurrent verified concern, not a demonstrated repository exploit: upstream actions/setup-go latest v7.0.0/tag v7 points to b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e; its official runtime package lock has fast-xml-parser 5.9.3. Active HIGH GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q affects >=5.9.3,<5.10.1 and fixes at5.10.1. Do not conflate dependency presence with proven vulnerable-path reachability in our workflow. Do not execute the action locally, alter upstream bundles or admin settings, or represent mechanical conflict resolution as security approval. Recheck authoritative target evidence; record unresolved concern separately.\\n\\nAcceptance: exact head/base/conflicts recorded, normal main merge preserving security pins and original intended action changes only, syntax/static and full repository pre-push verification without executing unsafe action code on host, independent accessible-diff review, one non-force existing-branch push if safe under that limited scope, and direct refreshed GitHub mergeability/head/CI next signal. Parent owns merge, review, post-merge cleanup and Linear lifecycle. No repeated Bugbot triggers for known bot-author access exclusion. Use exclusive isolated checkout and do not touch any other worker or parent worktree.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2138/entire-brain-resolve-setup-go-dependency-update-merge-conflicts\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2138-entire-brain-resolve-setup-go-dependency-update-merge\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-15T10:02:23.910Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:32:21.859Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:32:21.830Z\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-15T10:02:23.983Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Done\",\"statusType\":\"completed\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"44a9e882-5390-4856-a269-fb7686b821a4\",\"title\":\"Setup-go conflict repair — Trail 271\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}],"details":{"mode":"call","mcpResult":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2138\",\"uuid\":\"aa77932a-a36f-4709-9d78-0221aae0d1f8\",\"title\":\"entire-brain: resolve setup-go dependency-update merge conflicts\",\"description\":\"Resolve only the mechanical workflow conflicts for the existing setup-go major update linked to [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271>). User explicitly authorized parallel conflict-repair workers; do not merge any update.\\n\\nPreserve current main's toolchain/security fixes, workflow permissions, runners and unrelated actions. Keep conflict resolution within the original update's intended scope; no new privileges, source refactor, test/CI weakening, provenance changes, force-push or replacement PR. Stop on semantic uncertainty rather than guessing.\\n\\nCurrent verified concern, not a demonstrated repository exploit: upstream actions/setup-go latest v7.0.0/tag v7 points to b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e; its official runtime package lock has fast-xml-parser 5.9.3. Active HIGH GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q affects >=5.9.3,<5.10.1 and fixes at5.10.1. Do not conflate dependency presence with proven vulnerable-path reachability in our workflow. Do not execute the action locally, alter upstream bundles or admin settings, or represent mechanical conflict resolution as security approval. Recheck authoritative target evidence; record unresolved concern separately.\\n\\nAcceptance: exact head/base/conflicts recorded, normal main merge preserving security pins and original intended action changes only, syntax/static and full repository pre-push verification without executing unsafe action code on host, independent accessible-diff review, one non-force existing-branch push if safe under that limited scope, and direct refreshed GitHub mergeability/head/CI next signal. Parent owns merge, review, post-merge cleanup and Linear lifecycle. No repeated Bugbot triggers for known bot-author access exclusion. Use exclusive isolated checkout and do not touch any other worker or parent worktree.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2138/entire-brain-resolve-setup-go-dependency-update-merge-conflicts\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2138-entire-brain-resolve-setup-go-dependency-update-merge\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-15T10:02:23.910Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:32:21.859Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:32:21.830Z\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-15T10:02:23.983Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Done\",\"statusType\":\"completed\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"44a9e882-5390-4856-a269-fb7686b821a4\",\"title\":\"Setup-go conflict repair — Trail 271\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}]},"server":"linear","tool":"save_issue"},"isError":false,"durationMs":2314,"timestamp":1792110742588}}
