): render remedies in the reader's dispatch spelling\"},{\"headRefName\":\"fix/runnable-advice\",\"headRefOid\":\"f18b1e4eef3fe18747722ef850dd6e4beb7e828e\",\"isDraft\":false,\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"mergeable\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"number\":347,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix(cli): make printed advice runnable and name the escape hatch\"},{\"headRefName\":\"fix/dirty-gate-reconciled\",\"headRefOid\":\"dcee5030339e801aa05e8774ac64173e57b2df83\",\"isDraft\":false,\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"mergeable\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"number\":346,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix(gate): stop our own installers blocking our own install\"},{\"headRefName\":\"fix/setup-status-output-truth\",\"headRefOid\":\"1d666acf47edb188db9b8a3affa2cb7ee8c65c0f\",\"isDraft\":false,\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"mergeable\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"number\":345,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix(setup,status): say what is true on a first run\"},{\"headRefName\":\"fix/bundle-sharing-truth\",\"headRefOid\":\"156f832638e0dcdb37c30b67afcaf4a40248dbc1\",\"isDraft\":false,\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"mergeable\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"number\":344,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix(bundle): say what sharing a brain costs, at the moment it costs it\"},{\"headRefName\":\"fix/worker-says-why\",\"headRefOid\":\"9f27ce569a00cb438b66169b5032e373bc145404\",\"isDraft\":false,\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"mergeable\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"number\":343,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix(memory): say why a prepass failed, and stop retrying what cannot change\"},{\"headRefName\":\"fix/setup-wires-agents\",\"headRefOid\":\"9dea64038a7411ca36d3c62bcd671ddc6fe32f48\",\"isDraft\":false,\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"mergeable\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"number\":342,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix(setup): make the brain discoverable, and remember what the user declined\"},{\"headRefName\":\"fix/doctor-actionable\",\"headRefOid\":\"fb4b390babee202930fc73836da800afc36dca83\",\"isDraft\":false,\"merge