dd3d73ce904a\",\"terminal_title\":\"π - alex-nanoid-fixture-compat\",\"terminal_title_stripped\":\"π - alex-nanoid-fixture-compat\",\"workspace_id\":\"wQ3\"},\"type\":\"agent_info\"}}\nUsing context 'us.auth.entire.io'.\n{\n  \"trail\": \"269\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"head_sha\": \"cef529417a55efd4fd7e5cfce2c7279551224176\",\n  \"gh_pr_id\": 354,\n  \"main_review\": [\n    {\n      \"state\": \"evaluated\",\n      \"outcome\": \"passed\",\n      \"evaluated_at_sha\": \"cef529417a55efd4fd7e5cfce2c7279551224176\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nUsing context 'us.auth.entire.io'.\n{\n  \"trail\": \"272\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"head_sha\": \"4e8bdd8d50c5b36b37bf05a3cb3b98493fa150d6\",\n  \"gh_pr_id\": 357,\n  \"main_review\": [\n    {\n      \"state\": \"evaluated\",\n      \"outcome\": \"passed\",\n      \"evaluated_at_sha\": \"4e8bdd8d50c5b36b37bf05a3cb3b98493fa150d6\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nUsing context 'us.auth.entire.io'.\n{\n  \"trail\": \"277\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"head_sha\": \"c71ea21ecb48347f5b8f417a6b53eeded73151c6\",\n  \"gh_pr_id\": 362,\n  \"main_review\": [\n    {\n      \"state\": \"evaluated\",\n      \"outcome\": \"passed\",\n      \"evaluated_at_sha\": \"c71ea21ecb48347f5b8f417a6b53eeded73151c6\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":2486,"timestamp":1792111776001}}
{"type":"message","id":"d5d9455a","parentId":"6bacb21d","timestamp":"2026-10-16T00:49:36.002Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_88cb6af7830744faae590dc470b58a40|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad1749c525c81918f608cb52d219b6f","toolName":"mcp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2139\",\"uuid\":\"a29fee86-bb57-45c0-bb53-5a3ddb8a828c\",\"title\":\"entire-brain: resolve go-git dependency-update merge conflicts\",\"description\":\"Resolve only the mechanical conflicts for the existing go-git beta update linked to [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/277](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/277>). User explicitly authorized parallel conflict-repair workers in isolated checkouts; merges remain sequential and parent-owned.\\n\\nPreserve current main's merged security baseline and unrelated dependency selections. Retain the bot's intended update only if it does not undo an authoritative security fix; independently verify exact versions/fixed ancestry before running target code. Do not infer safety from beta version ordering. Resolve generated checksum/config conflicts normally; no force-push, authored-source conflict guesses, new privileges, test weakening, provenance migration, new PR, or admin changes. Stop for actual semantic/version-selection uncertainty.\\n\\nAcceptance: independently verified target/head/base and exact conflict scope; normal main merge, focused checks and full repository pre-push verification on resolved tree, independent diff review using a read-accessible artifact, non-force update to existing bot branch, current GitHub conflict status/head and CI next signal. Do not merge or claim full security readiness from conflict resolution. Existing bot-author Bugbot access restriction is reported, not retriggered repeatedly or bypassed. Parent owns review/merge/post-merge/cleanup/Linear lifecycle.\\n\\nUse one exclusive worker checkout. Do not touch nanoid's active fixture-repair workspace or the parent checkout. Coordinate overlapping go-billy manifest selections through parent metadata, not cross-worktree edits. Baseline <issue id=\\\"f657511b-fb0e-45ae-9a3c-c2712f68eecc\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2129/entire-brain-establish-a-verified-go-dependency-security-baseline\\\">COR-2129</issue> is complete; follow latest main rather than restoring older parent choices.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2139/entire-brain-resolve-go-git-dependency-update-merge-conflicts\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2139-entire-brain-resolve-go-git-dependency-update-merge\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-15T10:02:24.857Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:49:34.982Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-15T10:02:25.644Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"8b38d4af-2776-4a85-bcc1-ef094926c44d\",\"title\":\"Go-git conflict repair — Trail 277\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/277\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}],"details":{"mode":"call","mcpResult":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2139\",\"uuid\":\"a29fee86-bb57-45c0-bb53-5a3ddb8a828c\",\"title\":\"entire-brain: resolve go-git dependency-update merge conflicts\",\"description\":\"Resolve only the mechanical conflicts for the existing go-git beta update linked to [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/277](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/277>). User explicitly authorized parallel conflict-repair workers in isolated checkouts; merges remain sequential and parent-owned.\\n\\nPreserve current main's merged security baseline and unrelated dependency selections. Retain the bot's intended update only if it does not undo an authoritative security fix; independently verify exact versions/fixed ancestry before running target code. Do not infer safety from beta version ordering. Resolve generated checksum/config conflicts normally; no force-push, authored-source conflict guesses, new privileges, test weakening, provenance migration, new PR, or admin changes. Stop for actual semantic/version-selection uncertainty.\\n\\nAcceptance: independently verified target/head/base and exact conflict scope; normal main merge, focused checks and full repository pre-push verification on resolved tree, independent diff review using a read-accessible artifact, non-force update to existing bot branch, current GitHub conflict status/head and CI next signal. Do not merge or claim full security readiness from conflict resolution. Existing bot-author Bugbot access restriction is reported, not retriggered repeatedly or bypassed. Parent owns review/merge/post-merge/cleanup/Linear lifecycle.\\n\\nUse one exclusive worker checkout. Do not touch nanoid's active fixture-repair workspace or the parent checkout. Coordinate overlapping go-billy manifest selections through parent metadata, not cross-worktree edits. Baseline <issue id=\\\"f657511b-fb0e-45ae-9a3c-c2712f68eecc\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2129/entire-brain-establish-a-verified-go-dependency-security-baseline\\\">COR-2129</issue> is complete; follow latest main rather than restoring older parent choices.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2139/entire-brain-resolve-go-git-dependency-update-merge-conflicts\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2139-entire-brain-resolve-go-git-dependency-update-merge\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-15T10:02:24.857Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:49:34.982Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-15T10:02:25.644Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"8b38d4af-2776-4a85-bcc1-ef094926c44d\",\"title\":\"Go-git conflict repair — Trail 277\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/277\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}]},"server":"linear","tool":"save_issue"},"isError":false,"durationMs":3426,"timestamp":1792111776002}}
