nt: known vulnerable code present, no demonstrated current lower-trust exploit path; XML service-response path narrowed, Git automatic startup fallback corrected, no compatible published Git3 fix, latest node-llama patch insufficient. Both security issues remain unresolved; mitigation/remediation needs separate authorization/upstream support. No code/dependency/install/build/exploit changes, no workspaces or ongoing watches."}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","usage":{"input":498,"output":642,"cacheRead":151808,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":409,"totalTokens":152948,"cost":{"input":0.000996,"output":0.00642,"cacheRead":0.015180800000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0225968}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792212813342,"responseId":"resp_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad2ff4de76c819199c3ae7d70ecc3a2","rawStopReason":"completed","durationMs":12118,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}}
{"type":"message","id":"fb1800d5","parentId":"1897d101","timestamp":"2026-10-17T04:53:47.767Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_daa6c4f280624096880915dc120f52d8|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad2ff56d4648191a46d4b7dcbbde06a","toolName":"mcp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2145\",\"uuid\":\"dd6fe94b-6ae8-46b6-afd1-43bfa0085e5f\",\"title\":\"Assess setup-go v7 bundled XML-parser advisory and workflow exposure\",\"description\":\"Retain the unresolved security concern separately from completed mechanical conflict repair and recovered main CI.\\n\\nThe prior exact-target review observed actions/setup-go v7.0.0 / v7 at b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e with fast-xml-parser 5.9.3 in its upstream runtime inventory and bundle. GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q was active HIGH, affecting >=5.9.3,<5.10.1 with fix at 5.10.1. Presence in the bundle is not proof of attacker-controlled workflow reachability. The broader bounded audit did not establish overall security clearance. Refresh all current facts before choosing remediation.\\n\\nThe workflow update was subsequently merged (Trail 271); passing native or CI checks did not resolve this advisory. The separate macOS CGO Git-fixture failure recovered on one unchanged-commit diagnostic repeat and has no established causal connection to this concern.\\n\\nBounded acceptance:\\n\\n* Resolve the currently used v7 tag to its exact upstream commit and verify release/provenance.\\n* Check current authoritative GitHub/OSV advisory status and actual shipped runtime package versions, excluding dev-only inventory.\\n* Assess the relevant workflow input, credential and dataflow exposure without assuming that contents:read, lack of product-runtime shipping, or advisory counts alone prove safety/exploitability.\\n* If affected, propose an unambiguously compatible official patched release or another evidence-supported remediation through a separate reviewed slice. Do not rewrite upstream bundles or alter admin/security policy, historical receipts or production benchmark pins.\\n* Record explicit evidence-backed disposition; do not inherit a security clearance from successful CI.\\n\\nSources: [https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>) and [https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>). Related merged Trail: [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271>). No implementation is started by this issue.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2145/assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow-exposure\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2145-assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:27:49.124Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-17T04:53:47.004Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"5c86a822-8ef3-49ad-bba6-9c82e2b3bd21\",\"title\":\"Authoritative XML-parser advisory\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q\"},{\"id\":\"87173ad1-2079-4955-87e5-64d445819dee\",\"title\":\"Merged setup-go workflow update — Trail 271\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}],"details":{"mode":"call","mcpResult":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2145\",\"uuid\":\"dd6fe94b-6ae8-46b6-afd1-43bfa0085e5f\",\"title\":\"Assess setup-go v7 bundled XML-parser advisory and workflow exposure\",\"description\":\"Retain the unresolved security concern separately from completed mechanical conflict repair and recovered main CI.\\n\\nThe prior exact-target review observed actions/setup-go v7.0.0 / v7 at b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e with fast-xml-parser 5.9.3 in its upstream runtime inventory and bundle. GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q was active HIGH, affecting >=5.9.3,<5.10.1 with fix at 5.10.1. Presence in the bundle is not proof of attacker-controlled workflow reachability. The broader bounded audit did not establish overall security clearance. Refresh all current facts before choosing remediation.\\n\\nThe workflow update was subsequently merged (Trail 271); passing native or CI checks did not resolve this advisory. The separate macOS CGO Git-fixture failure recovered on one unchanged-commit diagnostic repeat and has no established causal connection to this concern.\\n\\nBounded acceptance:\\n\\n* Resolve the currently used v7 tag to its exact upstream commit and verify release/provenance.\\n* Check current authoritative GitHub/OSV advisory status and actual shipped runtime package versions, excluding dev-only inventory.\\n* Assess the relevant workflow input, credential and dataflow exposure without assuming that contents:read, lack of product-runtime shipping, or advisory counts alone prove safety/exploitability.\\n* If affected, propose an unambiguously compatible official patched release or another evidence-supported remediation through a separate reviewed slice. Do not rewrite upstream bundles or alter admin/security policy, historical receipts or production benchmark pins.\\n* Record explicit evidence-backed disposition; do not inherit a security clearance from successful CI.\\n\\nSources: [https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>) and [https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>). Related merged Trail: [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271>). No implementation is started by this issue.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2145/assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow-exposure\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2145-assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:27:49.124Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-17T04:53:47.004Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"5c86a822-8ef3-49ad-bba6-9c82e2b3bd21\",\"title\":\"Authoritative XML-parser advisory\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q\"},{\"id\":\"87173ad1-2079-4955-87e5-64d445819dee\",\"title\":\"Merged setup-go workflow update — Trail 271\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}]},"server":"linear","tool":"save_issue"},"isError":false,"durationMs":2304,"timestamp":1792212827767}}
{"type":"message","id":"44b69235","parentId":"fb1800d5","timestamp":"2026-10-17T04:53:47.767Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ea9662341f6f4ec49c46ac81025db836|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad2ff5947f88191b5fdb3695502a0bb","toolName":"mcp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2164\",\"uuid\":\"0f8d2d0f-fcde-46e9-9b15-a59cbfbc049b\",\"title\":\"Assess inherited critical argv-parser advisory in benchmark Git tooling\",\"description\":\"Read-only dependency-update review found an existing baseline security concern, not a newly introduced version regression.\\n\\nParent independently checked immutable baseline ad65996bee631e3044773407df48edc1e85e0c17 and updated heads bfbb527633840fbd1e76f395810adb1e36eeffb3 (tar) / 9a3f538b386ad22dca0f9d7f896f4f9e9c9234f5 (npm group). All three resolve simple-git 3.36.0 and @simple-git/argv-parser 1.1.1 in scripts/bench/package-lock.json. The group updates node-llama-cpp 3.18.1 to 3.22.1, but these two resolved versions are unchanged.\\n\\nCurrent authoritative GitHub advisory GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c is CRITICAL and not withdrawn; it affects npm @simple-git/argv-parser <2.0.1 and fixes at2.0.1. Its synopsis concerns VISUAL editor environment-variable omission from unsafe-editor detection. Lockfile presence is not proof that this project's usage reaches an exploitable operation. The read-only OSV lookup also returned GHSA-858h-whjf-mvg5, GHSA-g4wm-2vf7-vfgr and GHSA-x6jw-m9v5-85vh for simple-git3.36.0; verify exact status/ranges and relevant calls rather than treat counts as exploit evidence.\\n\\nBounded follow-up: trace actual benchmark/native-install simple-git operations and trusted versus untrusted editor/config/input flow, verify current authoritative advisory and upstream fix guidance, and determine a compatible official remediation. Do not force a simple-git4 major override or change unrelated dependencies without compatibility evidence. Record introduced-versus-inherited exposure explicitly; no production exploit or setup-go/macOS CGO causation is asserted. Passing CI alone is not security clearance.\\n\\nRelated update Trails:\\n[https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/269](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/269>)\\n[https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/272](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/272>)\\nAdvisory: [https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c](<https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c>)\\nNo implementation is started by this issue.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2164/assess-inherited-critical-argv-parser-advisory-in-benchmark-git\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2164-assess-inherited-critical-argv-parser-advisory-in-benchmark\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-16T02:58:29.297Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-17T04:53:46.774Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"c49dd410-e8d0-4366-bd72-1ae38ecf2643\",\"title\":\"npm grouped dependency update — Trail 272\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/272\"},{\"id\":\"1084ad53-30a3-401d-9cc1-dbbec9097018\",\"title\":\"Inherited npm Git-tooling advisory\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}],"details":{"mode":"call","mcpResult":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2164\",\"uuid\":\"0f8d2d0f-fcde-46e9-9b15-a59cbfbc049b\",\"title\":\"Assess inherited critical argv-parser advisory in benchmark Git tooling\",\"description\":\"Read-only dependency-update review found an existing baseline security concern, not a newly introduced version regression.\\n\\nParent independently checked immutable baseline ad65996bee631e3044773407df48edc1e85e0c17 and updated heads bfbb527633840fbd1e76f395810adb1e36eeffb3 (tar) / 9a3f538b386ad22dca0f9d7f896f4f9e9c9234f5 (npm group). All three resolve simple-git 3.36.0 and @simple-git/argv-parser 1.1.1 in scripts/bench/package-lock.json. The group updates node-llama-cpp 3.18.1 to 3.22.1, but these two resolved versions are unchanged.\\n\\nCurrent authoritative GitHub advisory GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c is CRITICAL and not withdrawn; it affects npm @simple-git/argv-parser <2.0.1 and fixes at2.0.1. Its synopsis concerns VISUAL editor environment-variable omission from unsafe-editor detection. Lockfile presence is not proof that this project's usage reaches an exploitable operation. The read-only OSV lookup also returned GHSA-858h-whjf-mvg5, GHSA-g4wm-2vf7-vfgr and GHSA-x6jw-m9v5-85vh for simple-git3.36.0; verify exact status/ranges and relevant calls rather than treat counts as exploit evidence.\\n\\nBounded follow-up: trace actual benchmark/native-install simple-git operations and trusted versus untrusted editor/config/input flow, verify current authoritative advisory and upstream fix guidance, and determine a compatible official remediation. Do not force a simple-git4 major override or change unrelated dependencies without compatibility evidence. Record introduced-versus-inherited exposure explicitly; no production exploit or setup-go/macOS CGO causation is asserted. Passing CI alone is not security clearance.\\n\\nRelated update Trails:\\n[https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/269](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/269>)\\n[https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/272](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/272>)\\nAdvisory: [https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c](<https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c>)\\nNo implementation is started by this issue.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2164/assess-inherited-critical-argv-parser-advisory-in-benchmark-git\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2164-assess-inherited-critical-argv-parser-advisory-in-benchmark\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-16T02:58:29.297Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-17T04:53:46.774Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"c49dd410-e8d0-4366-bd72-1ae38ecf2643\",\"title\":\"npm grouped dependency update — Trail 272\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/272\"},{\"id\":\"1084ad53-30a3-401d-9cc1-dbbec9097018\",\"title\":\"Inherited npm Git-tooling advisory\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb