\"terminal_title_stripped\":\"π - alex-ent-3095-trail-token-strip\",\"tokens\":{\"summary\":\"⏳ 1 subagent (worker)\",\"title-suffix\":\"⏳worker\"},\"workspace_id\":\"wQ2\"},{\"agent\":\"pi\",\"agent_session\":{\"agent\":\"pi\",\"kind\":\"path\",\"source\":\"herdr:pi\",\"value\":\"/Users/alex/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-alex-.herdr-worktrees-fleet-alex-ent-3046-activate-deploy-lib--/2026-10-15T23-23-36-947Z_01a141e0-d872-7311-9eeb-26a053b5503b.jsonl\"},\"agent_status\":\"idle\",\"completion_seq\":1831,\"cwd\":\"/Users/alex/.herdr/worktrees/fleet/alex-ent-3046-activate-deploy-lib\",\"focused\":false,\"foreground_cwd\":\"/Users/alex/.herdr/worktrees/fleet/alex-ent-3046-activate-deploy-lib\",\"interactive_ready\":true,\"name\":\"impl-ent-3046-activate-lib\",\"pane_id\":\"wQ9:p1\",\"revision\":120,\"screen_detection_skipped\":true,\"state_change_seq\":1831,\"tab_id\":\"wQ9:t1\",\"terminal_id\":\"term_65de95647717751\",\"terminal_title\":\"π - alex-ent-3046-activate-deploy-lib\",\"terminal_title_stripped\":\"π - alex-ent-3046-activate-deploy-lib\",\"workspace_id\":\"wQ9\"},{\"agent\":\"claude\",\"agent_session\":{\"agent\":\"claude\",\"kind\":\"id\",\"source\":\"herdr:claude\",\"value\":\"672c6888-b891-4dda-8ba2-438c0306ae29\"},\"agent_status\":\"idle\",\"completion_seq\":2232,\"cwd\":\"/Users/alex/.herdr/worktrees/agent-insights/alex-ent-2997-arm-promote\",\"focused\":false,\"foreground_cwd\":\"/Users/alex/.herdr/worktrees/agent-insights/alex-ent-2997-arm-promote\",\"interactive_ready\":true,\"name\":\"claude-ent-2997-arm-promote\",\"pane_id\":\"wQA:p1\",\"revision\":4,\"state_change_seq\":2232,\"tab_id\":\"wQA:t1\",\"terminal_id\":\"term_65e01d6b2c92e52\",\"terminal_title\":\"✳ ENT-2997 agent-insights automatic prod promotion\",\"terminal_title_stripped\":\"ENT-2997 agent-insights automatic prod promotion\",\"workspace_id\":\"wQA\"}],\"type\":\"agent_list\"}}\nherdr worktree commands:\n  herdr worktree list [--workspace ID | --cwd PATH] [--trust-repository]\n  herdr worktree create [--workspace ID | --cwd PATH] [--branch NAME] [--base REF] [--path PATH] [--label TEXT] [--focus] [--no-focus] [--trust-repository]\n  herdr worktree open [--workspace ID | --cwd PATH] (--path PATH | --branch NAME) [--label TEXT] [--focus] [--no-focus] [--trust-repository]\n  herdr worktree remove --workspace ID [--force] [--trust-repository]\nUsing context 'us.auth.entire.io'.\nTrail: chore(deps): bump actions/upload-artifact from 4 to 7\n  Number:  273\n  ID:      01M4R0WHHFWPY9AWETVBPZMB3P\n  Branch:  \n  Base:    main\n  Status:  merged\n  Author:  \n  URL:     https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/273\n  Assignees: dependabot[bot]\n  Type:      task\n  Reviewers: khaong (approved)\n  Created: 2026-10-12T12:20:04Z\n  Updated: 2026-10-16T00:42:25Z\n  Mergeable: no\n  Head:      6deecbaf\n  Conflicts: unknown\n  Gates:\n    ✓ approvals   passed  1 approval(s) recorded\n    ✓ checks      passed  CI checks have passed\n    ✓ findings    passed  Agent review found no blocking issues\n    ✓ up_to_date  passed  9 commits behind · Mergeable\n  Checks:    not applicable\n\nDescription:\nProblem: The GitHub Actions actions/upload-artifact action is pinned to outdated versions (v4 and v6) across CI workflows, introducing potential security and compatibility risks while preventing access to newer features and bug fixes.\nSolution: Upgrade all actions/upload-artifact references to version v7 across release and test workflows. This includes:\nRelease workflow: v4 → v7\nTest workflow browser smoke tests: v4 → v7\nTest workflow coverage and verification steps: v6 → v7 (10 occurrences)\nNo behavioral changes are required; the upgrade is a direct dependency version bump that maintains the same artifact upload functionality while gaining improvements from v7.\n"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":1263,"timestamp":1792360053021}}
