us creation receipt. COR-2145 is safely running/watched in its isolated checkout; the guard has no reconciliation API and refuses further workspace creation even with the valid first workspace/watch recorded. No COR-2164 workspace or agent was created; no code was changed for this issue. Requires owner-authorized guard reset/reload before retrying the same launch protocol. No alternate harness or bypass attempted.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:58:43.886Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:58:43.771Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"name\":\"Alex Ong\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}"}]},"server":"linear","tool":"save_comment"},"isError":false,"durationMs":1465,"timestamp":1792360725613}}
{"type":"message","id":"716673f4","parentId":"43ae9b3a","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:58:45.613Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0a70527368834ba7a3d91bd13830b0ab|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad54112a9e48191852b73933352c4ed","toolName":"mcp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2164\",\"uuid\":\"0f8d2d0f-fcde-46e9-9b15-a59cbfbc049b\",\"title\":\"Assess inherited critical argv-parser advisory in benchmark Git tooling\",\"description\":\"Read-only dependency-update review found an existing baseline security concern, not a newly introduced version regression.\\n\\nParent independently checked immutable baseline ad65996bee631e3044773407df48edc1e85e0c17 and updated heads bfbb527633840fbd1e76f395810adb1e36eeffb3 (tar) / 9a3f538b386ad22dca0f9d7f896f4f9e9c9234f5 (npm group). All three resolve simple-git 3.36.0 and @simple-git/argv-parser 1.1.1 in scripts/bench/package-lock.json. The group updates node-llama-cpp 3.18.1 to 3.22.1, but these two resolved versions are unchanged.\\n\\nCurrent authoritative GitHub advisory GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c is CRITICAL and not withdrawn; it affects npm @simple-git/argv-parser <2.0.1 and fixes at2.0.1. Its synopsis concerns VISUAL editor environment-variable omission from unsafe-editor detection. Lockfile presence is not proof that this project's usage reaches an exploitable operation. The read-only OSV lookup also returned GHSA-858h-whjf-mvg5, GHSA-g4wm-2vf7-vfgr and GHSA-x6jw-m9v5-85vh for simple-git3.36.0; verify exact status/ranges and relevant calls rather than treat counts as exploit evidence.\\n\\nBounded follow-up: trace actual benchmark/native-install simple-git operations and trusted versus untrusted editor/config/input flow, verify current authoritative advisory and upstream fix guidance, and determine a compatible official remediation. Do not force a simple-git4 major override or change unrelated dependencies without compatibility evidence. Record introduced-versus-inherited exposure explicitly; no production exploit or setup-go/macOS CGO causation is asserted. Passing CI alone is not security clearance.\\n\\nRelated update Trails:\\n[https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/269](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/269>)\\n[https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/272](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/272>)\\nAdvisory: [https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c](<https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c>)\\nNo implementation is started by this issue.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2164/assess-inherited-critical-argv-parser-advisory-in-benchmark-git\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2164-assess-inherited-critical-argv-parser-advisory-in-benchmark\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-16T02:58:29.297Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:58:44.876Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"c49dd410-e8d0-4366-bd72-1ae38ecf2643\",\"title\":\"npm grouped dependency update — Trail 272\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/272\"},{\"id\":\"1084ad53-30a3-401d-9cc1-dbbec9097018\",\"title\":\"Inherited npm Git-tooling advisory\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v5rq-49vh-5v5c\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"919