{"type":"message","id":"51aecc97","parentId":"8342c4e9","timestamp":"2026-10-18T23:23:35.405Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_55a971ea269d40d5a54676e232fabcc8|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad554f53dfc8191b40204ff848624bc","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Using context 'us.auth.entire.io'.\nTrail: fix(security): pin setup-go to fixed parser bundle\n  Number:  317\n  ID:      01M58M7ZXAD6Y9DDJGVTAJFPQT\n  Branch:  alex/cor-2145-setup-go-security\n  Base:    main\n  Status:  open\n  Author:  khaong\n  Phase:   reviewing\n  URL:     https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/317\n  Assignees: khaong\n  Type:      task\n  Created: 2026-10-18T23:06:13Z\n  Updated: 2026-10-18T23:06:13Z\n  Mergeable: no\n  Head:      0a726685\n  Conflicts: clean\n  Gates:\n    ✗ approvals    failed   No reviewers have approved this trail\n    - base_checks  skipped  (non-blocking)\n    ✓ checks       passed   CI checks have passed\n    ✓ findings     passed   Agent review found no blocking issues\n    ✓ up_to_date   passed   Up to date\n  Checks:    34 passed · 0 running · 0 failed (34 total)\n\nDescription:\nProblem: The branch's CI and release workflows used the floating actions/setup-go@v7 tag, so any change to that tag would change the Go toolchain setup that runs in builds. Those workflows could pick up a parser fix or regression without review.\nSolution: Every actions/setup-go reference in the workflows now points to one commit SHA, 90ad2b35f69faf97585ad74d28fa006d2739b7af, which is the official v7.0.0 bundle with the repeated-DOCTYPE parser fix. The change touches test.yml (about 20 uses), nightly.yml, and release.yml. The Go version inputs are unchanged.\nTo keep the pin from drifting, the branch adds:\n.github/scripts/check-setup-go-pin.sh, which scans all workflow files and fails if any setup-go reference is not that exact SHA or if none are found.\n.github/scripts/test-check-setup-go-pin.sh, which tests the check against temporary workflow fixtures. It covers passing and failing cases, .yml and .yaml files, and a missing workflow directory.\nTwo new steps at the start of the test.yml job that run both scripts before any Go setup.\nUser-visible effect: None on the CLI, MCP, retrieval, caches, export/sync, or privacy. The effect is on CI and release builds only. Builds now use a fixed toolchain setup action, and a new CI check fails if someone reintroduces a floating tag. The test.yml workflow now runs two extra shell steps before the Go build.\nList findings for a trail\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail finding list [<trail>] [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --cursor string       Continue from the next cursor returned by a previous page\n      --freshness string    Filter code-version freshness: current,stale,any (default \"current\")\n  -h, --help                help for list\n      --include-dismissed   Include dismissed findings\n      --json                Output as JSON\n  -n, --limit int           Maximum number of findings to show (default 100)\n      --severity string     Filter by comma-separated severity value(s): high,medium,low\n      --status string       Filter by lifecycle status(es): open,resolved,dismissed; use 'any' for all (default \"open\")\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --branch string   Resolve the trail for this branch instead of the current branch; cannot be combined with a trail selector\n      --context name    Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n      --repo string     Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; defaults to the origin remote\n      --trail string    Trail selector (number, id, or branch); defaults to the current branch's trail\n{\"has_more\":false,\"head\":\"0a7266858c6b08e6384d94111395f26baf5dce6b\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\",\"unresolved_threads\":0}\n20\t0\t.github/scripts/check-setup-go-pin.sh\n69\t0\t.github/scripts/test-check-setup-go-pin.sh\n1\t1\t.github/workflows/nightly.yml\n1\t1\t.github/workflows/release.yml\n18\t14\t.github/workflows/test.yml\n2026-10-18T23:23:35Z\n"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":1992,"timestamp":1792365815405}}
