{"type":"message","id":"95faf5db","parentId":"4f75e593","timestamp":"2026-10-18T23:26:08.168Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_e2e6754b710c40af87c91e0bc7d9067c|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad55581e3648191a889a35276045cee","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"orchestration_id\":\"security-remediation-wPB-20261018\",\"objective\":\"Resolve COR-2145 and COR-2164 through isolated owned slices; reconcile merged Trail273 cleanup\",\"orchestrator_workspace_id\":\"wPB\",\"orchestrator_pane_id\":\"wPB:p1\",\"started_at\":\"2026-10-18T21:53:20.074Z\",\"pieces\":[{\"piece_id\":\"cor2145\",\"issue_id\":\"COR-2145\",\"source_workspace_id\":\"wGX\",\"branch\":\"alex/cor-2145-setup-go-security\",\"harness\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"openai-codex/gpt-6-luna\",\"agent_name\":\"impl-cor-2145-setup-go\",\"prompt_attempts\":1,\"state\":\"review_readiness_refresh\",\"outcome\":\"Published0a7266858c6b08e6384d94111395f26baf5dce6b;5files109+/16-,clean. Exact Ubuntu24.04.5x86_64/Python3.14.8/coverage7.16.1 suitepassed;Macfailurequalified;lintbaseline21labels+2SC2035sameasmain. ParentfreshCIordinarychecksallgreenincludingWindows,mergeableMERGEABLE,threads0,openfindings0,noPagination. Trailopenapproval-only gatefailure. Ownercurrentpassedmain/Bugbot and4currentmonitors(10opinion+1stale,noactionrecorded) receipt needsfullcurrentaggregate refresh because review_monitor status reportedSourceUnavailable after addemitted_settled. Existingwatchretainedfor humanmerge/postmerge. No merge/cleanup/Done. Stewardprocessdeviationsnoted;hostPythonreadonlyguardPASS\",\"workspace_id\":\"wQC\",\"pane_id\":\"wQC:p1\",\"checkout_path\":\"/Users/alex/.herdr/worktrees/entire-brain/alex-cor-2145-setup-go-security\",\"agent_watch_id\":\"herdr-watch-8927d890-db45-4327-b0af-7e1f5d54569d\",\"armed_at\":\"2026-10-18T23:25:23.774Z\",\"pr\":\"entireio/entire-brain#404\",\"trail\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/317\",\"pr_watch_id\":\"review_monitor:entireio/entire-brain#404\"},{\"piece_id\":\"cor2164\",\"issue_id\":\"COR-2164\",\"source_workspace_id\":\"wGX\",\"branch\":\"alex/cor-2164-benchmark-git-security\",\"harness\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"openai-codex/gpt-6-sol\",\"agent_name\":\"impl-cor-2164-benchmark-git\",\"prompt_attempts\":0,\"state\":\"dispatch_blocked\",\"dependencies\":\"Launch infrastructure reset; COR-2154 removal claim remains unverified\",\"outcome\":\"No workspace created. Guard retained ambiguous first-creation receipt; owner-authorized reload/reconciliation required before further launch\"}]}\n"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":109,"timestamp":1792365968168}}
{"type":"message","id":"e8a71300","parentId":"95faf5db","timestamp":"2026-10-18T23:26:08.169Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7a6633b9e1974eb4be35b3f6b3dbb011|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad5558ceac481918468816f89bac2a4","toolName":"mcp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2145\",\"uuid\":\"dd6fe94b-6ae8-46b6-afd1-43bfa0085e5f\",\"title\":\"Assess setup-go v7 bundled XML-parser advisory and workflow exposure\",\"description\":\"Retain the unresolved security concern separately from completed mechanical conflict repair and recovered main CI.\\n\\nThe prior exact-target review observed actions/setup-go v7.0.0 / v7 at b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e with fast-xml-parser 5.9.3 in its upstream runtime inventory and bundle. GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q was active HIGH, affecting >=5.9.3,<5.10.1 with fix at 5.10.1. Presence in the bundle is not proof of attacker-controlled workflow reachability. The broader bounded audit did not establish overall security clearance. Refresh all current facts before choosing remediation.\\n\\nThe workflow update was subsequently merged (Trail 271); passing native or CI checks did not resolve this advisory. The separate macOS CGO Git-fixture failure recovered on one unchanged-commit diagnostic repeat and has no established causal connection to this concern.\\n\\nBounded acceptance:\\n\\n* Resolve the currently used v7 tag to its exact upstream commit and verify release/provenance.\\n* Check current authoritative GitHub/OSV advisory status and actual shipped runtime package versions, excluding dev-only inventory.\\n* Assess the relevant workflow input, credential and dataflow exposure without assuming that contents:read, lack of product-runtime shipping, or advisory counts alone prove safety/exploitability.\\n* If affected, propose an unambiguously compatible official patched release or another evidence-supported remediation through a separate reviewed slice. Do not rewrite upstream bundles or alter admin/security policy, historical receipts or production benchmark pins.\\n* Record explicit evidence-backed disposition; do not inherit a security clearance from successful CI.\\n\\nSources: [https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>) and [https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>). Related merged Trail: [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271>). No implementation is started by this issue.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2145/assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow-exposure\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2145-assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:27:49.124Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T23:26:07.326Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:53:21.990Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Review\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"ecfbc412-4c03-49ea-9f2e-2eb3013bd153\",\"title\":\"fix(security): pin setup-go to fixed parser bundle\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/404\"},{\"id\":\"5c86a822-8ef3-49ad-bba6-9c82e2b3bd21\",\"title\":\"Authoritative XML-parser advisory\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q\"},{\"id\":\"87173ad1-2079-4955-87e5-64d445819dee\",\"title\":\"Merged setup-go workflow update — Trail 271\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}],"details":{"mode":"call","mcpResult":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2145\",\"uuid\":\"dd6fe94b-6ae8-46b6-afd1-43bfa0085e5f\",\"title\":\"Assess setup-go v7 bundled XML-parser advisory and workflow exposure\",\"description\":\"Retain the unresolved security concern separately from completed mechanical conflict repair and recovered main CI.\\n\\nThe prior exact-target review observed actions/setup-go v7.0.0 / v7 at b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e with fast-xml-parser 5.9.3 in its upstream runtime inventory and bundle. GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q was active HIGH, affecting >=5.9.3,<5.10.1 with fix at 5.10.1. Presence in the bundle is not proof of attacker-controlled workflow reachability. The broader bounded audit did not establish overall security clearance. Refresh all current facts before choosing remediation.\\n\\nThe workflow update was subsequently merged (Trail 271); passing native or CI checks did not resolve this advisory. The separate macOS CGO Git-fixture failure recovered on one unchanged-commit diagnostic repeat and has no established causal connection to this concern.\\n\\nBounded acceptance:\\n\\n* Resolve the currently used v7 tag to its exact upstream commit and verify release/provenance.\\n* Check current authoritative GitHub/OSV advisory status and actual shipped runtime package versions, excluding dev-only inventory.\\n* Assess the relevant workflow input, credential and dataflow exposure without assuming that contents:read, lack of product-runtime shipping, or advisory counts alone prove safety/exploitability.\\n* If affected, propose an unambiguously compatible official patched release or another evidence-supported remediation through a separate reviewed slice. Do not rewrite upstream bundles or alter admin/security policy, historical receipts or production benchmark pins.\\n* Record explicit evidence-backed disposition; do not inherit a security clearance from successful CI.\\n\\nSources: [https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>) and [https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>). Related merged Trail: [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271>). No implementation is started by this issue.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2145/assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow-exposure\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2145-assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:27:49.124Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T23:26:07.326Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:53:21.990Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Review\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"ecfbc412-4c03-49ea-9f2e-2eb3013bd153\",\"title\":\"fix(security): pin setup-go to fixed parser bundle\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/404\"},{\"id\":\"5c86a822-8ef3-49ad-bba6-9c82e2b3bd21\",\"title\":\"Authoritative XML-parser advisory\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q\"},{\"id\":\"87173ad1-2079-4955-87e5-64d445819dee\",\"title\":\"Merged setup-go workflow update — Trail 271\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}]},"server":"linear","tool":"save_issue"},"isError":false,"durationMs":2953,"timestamp":1792365968169}}
{"type":"message","id":"ba4c49f5","parentId":"e8a71300","timestamp":"2026-10-18T23:26:08.169Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9a946473f1944a1da57a85b8520566ba|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad5558ceac48191bfd7dcc9ae3264cc","toolName":"mcp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"3cbf5eac-86ac-4010-8822-bbd8f278e18d\",\"body\":\"Implementation published: [Trail 317](https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/317), currently open. Five-file change pins all 16 setup-go invocations to official immutable upstream commit `90ad2b35f69faf97585ad74d28fa006d2739b7af`, whose checked-in bundles contain the parser fix; it is not a newly released v7 tag. Go versions and caching are preserved. Includes a pin guard and six fixture cases.\\n\\nThe exact Ubuntu 24.04.5 x86_64 / Python3.14.8 / coverage7.16.1 coverage unit suite passed in an isolated local container. The earlier macOS coverage failure remains explicitly qualified, not declared fixed. Existing default-branch actionlint diagnostics were compared and retained, not silently reported clean.\\n\\nParent observation at current published head `0a7266858c6b08e6384d94111395f26baf5dce6b`: ordinary CI build/test checks, including all Windows checks, now pass; GitHub MERGEABLE; zero unresolved threads; fresh Trail open-findings query zero with no pagination. Trail checks/findings/up-to-date pass and its approval gate awaits a human. Owner is supplying final complete authenticated main-review/monitor receipt; no blanket merge-ready/security-clearance claim yet. Parent merge/post-merge watch is registered. No merge, final cleanup, or Done.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-18T23:26:07.379Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T23:26:07.351Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"name\":\"Alex Ong\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}"}],"details":{"mode":"call","mcpResult":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"3cbf5eac-86ac-4010-8822-bbd8f278e18d\",\"body\":\"Implementation published: [Trail 317](https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/317), currently open. Five-file change pins all 16 setup-go invocations to official immutable upstream commit `90ad2b35f69faf97585ad74d28fa006d2739b7af`, whose checked-in bundles contain the parser fix; it is not a newly released v7 tag. Go versions and caching are preserved. Includes a pin guard and six fixture cases.\\n\\nThe exact Ubuntu 24.04.5 x86_64 / Python3.14.8 / coverage7.16.1 coverage unit suite passed in an isolated local container. The earlier macOS coverage failure remains explicitly qualified, not declared fixed. Existing default-branch actionlint diagnostics were compared and retained, not silently reported clean.\\n\\nParent observation at current published head `0a7266858c6b08e6384d94111395f26baf5dce6b`: ordinary CI build/test checks, including all Windows checks, now pass; GitHub MERGEABLE; zero unresolved threads; fresh Trail open-findings query zero with no pagination. Trail checks/findings/up-to-date pass and its approval gate awaits a human. Owner is supplying final complete authenticated main-review/monitor receipt; no blanket merge-ready/security-clearance claim yet. Parent merge/post-merge watch is registered. No merge, final cleanup, or Done.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-18T23:26:07.379Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18T23:26:07.351Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"name\":\"Alex Ong\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}"}]},"server":"linear","tool":"save_comment"},"isError":false,"durationMs":3084,"timestamp":1792365968169}}
