9k9uQODpg_9QzDzqhFzSLFWbGWArUMZdsZx8vpncjpLa0A-oMdiG4HlQR-wvcpLFi7tfYnEG8QtFdhWDpcw-NztUSQbKSqUxm2i7lYFaxQys2Js29OOSfLAu0MhyoQREThC0TIGuyYzMNuRU5gl0dYH_QIYGGhXfVYFgK4sLXkEha6y-rMwxr5Bjp_iznKUrPRPofZv_uZOXJSTKCCLOXcbcN67uuBbceBNVGP6a2EPbWTMFFeVddIZwa_Bkq955FO9y8f6P3ErkOWGpmpJ9i9NRLzqHGxtOoSiFsebKvzrw8aQgKlVO7WDBXkVUrCaPqMKzSf1ENweSfcaqzEId6g3jgCnaJgAyLrMuqv5GfKAzwLZkvkXGcGT-y2U3KMVFkMoolSOPJ9gmVup-r26pTvfWSjmeQW3ZCiC8AXciXW1wtvouSp9GW8KUS_qIOvNP7RW1ytak7iJpvcpzAfzNr5i7M7-udpVo2zzZ29jMfsFiLo82V4LA1BWx6wShGaYhIj6aPaxB-DVfY51N4z_TyaKyS93fd3WoLTShbFcdAh3XsipfRpEoi1X_gzIAQQFv7cYytPP8vkQnfc_-G7tKzUeSGF8KUKIlCDOD1omU7yRqLk4EOGYTzH0pWvkK6OJMU-4Z4aLvUn2DDjkGF3aZpCWAhb0umUGxieXaUkqA-EDmguKa1oJukduhZX1AjppqP3eQOfe_VZK9OF0fio39BgB8Li41RDdEWvHNmes5k4PfF7nk5hfI-x1cpQZ6pQ4DUEVTmKRqzBi5Rq6PxqH1ve2cxGosK0BC-TBpNwK5F2E2XR_6nJv1ml3rPry9SnO5nYfLOXo0fviquXRpNfP1Or7fbBtvkUe8zUY8FmT6CtFJjJMDXtCo3Qd6GF-me0_9mj9YfmN0m3yJhrF9YScDRnY-Tvw5nPVzpgM8Kr3waKDJpDBiidCEhbzmGhgwH4UttmBbEkqYpuPlMcUL3ruNZHfL8AQPfhity93Uoic7NQyDsnz_iWYkGp9hzubIk_Tir5KjijoA\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"**It’s a small, low-priority hardening change—not a demonstrated exploitable hole.**\n\n317 does two useful things:\n- Removes a known **CPU/memory exhaustion flaw** from the setup-go bundle.\n- Pins the action so a mutable tag cannot silently change what CI executes.\n\nBut the relevant XML comes from cache-service responses. We found **no demonstrated contributor-controlled attack path**, product exposure, or secret-disclosure vulnerability.\n\nThe tradeoffs are pinning an unreleased upstream commit and maintaining a custom pin-enforcement guard.\n\n**My judgment:** I pushed this further than the demonstrated risk warranted. I wouldn’t block a release on it. Waiting for an official patched release is reasonable; if we merge something now, I’d favor the simple SHA pin without the custom guard machinery.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad55bef88fc8191811d8461613872bf\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","usage":{"input":177,"output":1198,"cacheRead":359808,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1034,"totalTokens":361183,"cost":{"input":0.000708,"output":0.01797,"cacheRead":0.0719616,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0906396}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1792367572954,"responseId":"resp_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad55bd5fc4481919ec5bdd00cea02b6","rawStopReason":"completed","durationMs":29679,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}}
