                                                                                                                  │\n Update existing human PR and automatically linked canonical https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/317 descriptions to remove obsolete guard/testing claims, keeping accurate                 │\n immutable-upstream-commit versus v7 release-tag distinction. No manual replacement Trail. After publication, own/resume your same steward through current-head CI/Bugbot/main                            │\n review/threads/findings/present-monitor receipt. Return new SHA, final scope/size, verification evidence, canonical Trail status and full aggregate readiness or exact next signal; no per-claim         │\n rationale to parent. If only human approval remains after full conjunction, handoff without approval polling.                                                                                            │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Parent alone handles Linear, merge confirmation, actual-merge checks, final cleanup/removal. No merge or cleanup. Python incident restrictions/exact interpreter guard persist; no host                  │\n wrappers/shims/symlinks/global changes, no unsafe payloads. Parent will watch this existing owner and re-arm the same review/merge monitor when the new head is published. Continue now to simplify and  │\n publish; this is not another investigation-only request.                                                                                                                                                 │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Alex additionally asks whether Depend