                                                           │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n Thinking...                                                                                                                                                                                              │\n                                                                                                                                                                                                          │\n✓ bash date -u +%FT%TZ\n\n Thinking...\n\n I resumed the same review-steward run for the authorized scope reduction. The steward now owns the checkout; I will not make competing edits or rerun the preflight/review fanout.\n Thinking...\n\n I resumed the same review-steward for the authorized guard-removal change. It now owns the checkout; I made no competing edits. The next signal is that steward’s bounded simplification, publication,\n and current-head refresh. I did not start another preflight or review run.\n\n\n [subagent] review-steward needs a decision (ctrl+o to expand)\n\n\n\n Inspect subagent updates above. Answer pending supervisor requests within your authority. For completed work, read saved results and resume the already-authorized parent task, or report completion. If\n approval is required, explicitly ask the user. Do not silently yield, rerun completed work, or infer new authorization.\n\n\n Thinking...\n\n\n subagent_supervisor action=\"reply\" replyTo=\"3de3f9a8-177f-46bc-8890-58ca070a768a\" message=\"Yes. By “no new external r...\n Replied to supervisor request 3de3f9a8-177f-46bc-88