{"type":"message","id":"1ed53aca","parentId":"82a24cc2","timestamp":"2026-10-19T01:22:31.775Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5312d9aea31b4fcaa45742c61e1448b8|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad570d6ea2c8191a12f725760fdfd38","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# COR-2145 cleanup and release receipt\n\n## Repository state\n- Repository: `entireio/entire-brain`\n- Checkout: `/Users/alex/.herdr/worktrees/entire-brain/alex-cor-2145-setup-go-security`\n- Local branch/ref intentionally retained: `alex/cor-2145-setup-go-security` at `158038f1e9475575abe157433b2e7a16f2690ff5`. The remote feature ref is gone after merge. No branch deletion, reset, rebase, or force push was performed.\n- Trail: https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/317, status `merged`; merge time `2026-10-19T00:44:26Z`; local footer updated `merged`, observed `2026-10-19T01:12:59Z`.\n- Final source change was pin-only: 16 setup-go refs in three workflows, no guard/test scripts or extra CI steps. No further repository changes after merge.\n- `git status --short`: clean tracked state, index clean, zero nonignored untracked files. `git status --ignored` showed 228 ignored files under `.entire/logs`, `.entire/metadata`, `.entire/tmp`, `benchmarks/agent-brain/cache`, and Python `__pycache__` directories. They were not deleted; archive below preserves them. No tracked `.entire` file was purged.\n\n## Parent post-merge success receipt\nRead and validated `/Users/alex/.local/state/herdr/orchestrations/security-remediation-wPB-20261018/postmerge-317/success-receipt.json`.\n\n- Actual merge commit: `4d0b06882ad19a22926d3ac668190c1b54ea15ff`.\n- Default branch: `main`; observed branch head equals that merge SHA at `2026-10-19T00:53:34.217Z`.\n- Required-check selection was sourced from both classic protection and rules: **18 names, 18/18 terminal successes**, each on the actual merge SHA with app constraints preserved.\n- Parent received native `post_merge_success`; successful push run identity: `entireio/entire-brain` test workflow run `39182128827`, attempt 1, conclusion `success` on the actual merge SHA.\n- Parent-owned watch `review_monitor:entireio/entire-brain#404` remains parent-owned; it was not stopped or retargeted.\n\n## Private archives and retained resources\n- Owner-only archive directory: `/Users/alex/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-alex-.herdr-worktrees-entire-brain-alex-cor-2145-setup-go-security--/2026-10-18T21-54-05-618Z_01a15101-f6b1-7161-bfff-285df37d40b5/private/cor2145` (directories mode `0700`).\n- Ignored checkout snapshot: `ignored-worktree-state.tar.gz`, mode `0600`, 228 file entries, SHA-256 `c6011856d5bf256a76643bcc9a5be6c2512bdc34c7bb786c036dba1b204e6825`.\n- Steward-held private monitor claims and upstream inspection material: `steward-private-evidence.tar.gz`, mode `0600`, SHA-256 `f6a462848e08c7c6f118c3fc1dbd1ce7533067666fd5eb9ecac556b7979de09f`. Its claim rationale remains private and is not reproduced here.\n- Session artifact `cor2145-progress.md` and exact unfiltered actionlint baseline/current logs remain in `.../subagent-artifacts/`.\n\n## Owned resource cleanup\n- Disposable verification container `cor2145-python-coverage-ci-20261019`, ID `d09820e31fbac11c073af9e561218071e35735f9fd5cb28cb98709bc97f3007c`, and pulled image `ubuntu@sha256:68ee22004a9109b44973313b02ff7b1de250f1de0f5ecb628d73f579aaff33ac` were removed and verified absent. It had no volume, no host home/credentials/Docker-socket mount, and no privileged mode. No host Docker install was performed. The existing Docker daemon was not started/stopped by this work.\n- Idempotent container/image cleanup (already performed):\n  ```sh\n  if docker container inspect cor2145-python-coverage-ci-20261019 >/dev/null 2>&1; then docker rm -f cor2145-python-coverage-ci-20261019; fi\n  if docker image inspect ubuntu:24.04 >/dev/null 2>&1; then docker image rm ubuntu:24.04; fi\n  ```\n- Removed temporary Python dependency target, `/tmp/cor2145-playwright`, `webui/node_modules`, `webui/test-results`, temporary PR/Trail body files, preflight diff, and steward `/tmp/trail317-*` source copies after archiving the latter. No application server, tunnel, or other owned service remains.\n- Shared Go module/build caches and user npm cache were not purged; no global host configuration/auth/Python changes were made. The Playwright cache predated this task and was not deleted.\n\n## Verification, review, and residuals\n- Current main now contains the pin-only change. The exact pinned action commit has package version 7.0.0 and a fixed runtime bundle but is not the v7 release tag; the `v7` tag remains at the old commit. This is not a blanket security clearance. Broader action SHA policy remains out of scope.\n- The host macOS Python 3.14.8 coverage suite had one subprocess-coverage test failure; the test/runner are unchanged from `origin/main`. The same full suite passed in official Ubuntu 24.04.5 x86_64/Python 3.14.8/coverage 7.16.1 environment; retain the macOS failure as a qualified separate result.\n- Unfiltered actionlint baseline contained 21 unknown Depot runner-label diagnostics and 2 inline ShellCheck SC2035 diagnostics on both base and branch; filtered result passed, not described as a clean unfiltered run.\n- Prior steward process deviations are disclosed in the progress receipt: one administrative PATH `python3` JSON-formatting call despite the exact-interpreter rule, and a global Pi mission listing that pruned stale pointer-index entries with absent backing records. No recovery was attempted; no source mission, workspace, credentials, or repository config were changed.\n\n## Ownership release\nAll six child runs are complete; no child writer or owned background service remains. Checkout writer ownership is released to the parent. Do not remove the Herdr workspace, stop the parent review monitor, mutate Linear, or mark Done. Parent alone verifies this receipt, gracefully closes the agent, removes the worktree, and completes issue lifecycle after its workspace-removal receipt.\n"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":1,"timestamp":1792372951775}}
