{"type":"message","id":"c1a0a18c","parentId":"452b001b","timestamp":"2026-10-19T01:26:04.578Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b04f00167cb34a78b5027f6e9903459f|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad571a5ac1081919efe01fc519afd28","name":"mcp","arguments":{"tool":"linear_save_issue","args":{"id":"COR-2145","state":"Done"}}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fd0cbbf7b6ac4e5ab5bbf1622a5058a0|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad571ac46788191856eb006c9a55b22","name":"mcp","arguments":{"tool":"linear_save_comment","args":{"issueId":"COR-2145","body":"Completed cleanup for merged [Trail 317](https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/317).\n\n* Actual merge `4d0b06882ad19a22926d3ac668190c1b54ea15ff`: all 18 required checks independently verified successful with complete classic/rules inventory and same-merge main push run.\n* Owner cleanup/release receipt collected; no active child writer or owned service remains. Owned disposable container/image independently confirmed absent.\n* Ignored session/cache state and private review evidence preserved in private archives outside the checkout; parent verified hashes/permissions and captured final post-exit state.\n* Agent exited gracefully to Fish. Worker workspace removed **without force**; checkout path, Git worktree entry and Herdr workspace entry independently verified absent at 2026-10-19T01:24:47Z.\n* Local publication ref and durable evidence intentionally retained. Parent controller and unrelated workspaces untouched.\n\nCOR-2145 is Done. This does not close COR-2164 or imply universal dependency security clearance."}}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_54cd52397deb4cf28ce082887bf4c86c|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad571ac467881918ff7d826c92c9399","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"node /Users/alex/.local/state/herdr/orchestrations/security-remediation-wPB-20261018/state.mjs cor2145 '{\"state\":\"removed\",\"cleanup\":\"Ownerreleased;parentverifiedarchives/resources/cleanstate;CtrlD->Fish;herdrworktreeremove wQC forced=false;path/Git/Herdrabsenceverified2026-10-19T01:24:47Z. Receiptpostmerge-317/cleanup-removal-receipt.json\",\"outcome\":\"Merged4d actual18/18requiredsuccess, ownercleanupandnonforceremovalverified;COR2145completionauthorized. Localpublicationref/evidence retained, parentwPB/otherworkspacespreserved. COR2164stillblockedseparately\"}'","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","usage":{"input":3243,"output":480,"cacheRead":435328,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":439051,"cost":{"input":0.012972,"output":0.0072,"cacheRead":0.0870656,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.1072376}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792373154105,"responseId":"resp_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad571a331ac8191a7a25de516eb300e","rawStopReason":"completed","durationMs":10472,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}}
{"type":"message","id":"1531d978","parentId":"c1a0a18c","timestamp":"2026-10-19T01:26:08.420Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b04f00167cb34a78b5027f6e9903459f|fc_0b16ddefcb78f265016ad571a5ac1081919efe01fc519afd28","toolName":"mcp","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2145\",\"uuid\":\"dd6fe94b-6ae8-46b6-afd1-43bfa0085e5f\",\"title\":\"Assess setup-go v7 bundled XML-parser advisory and workflow exposure\",\"description\":\"Retain the unresolved security concern separately from completed mechanical conflict repair and recovered main CI.\\n\\nThe prior exact-target review observed actions/setup-go v7.0.0 / v7 at b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e with fast-xml-parser 5.9.3 in its upstream runtime inventory and bundle. GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q was active HIGH, affecting >=5.9.3,<5.10.1 with fix at 5.10.1. Presence in the bundle is not proof of attacker-controlled workflow reachability. The broader bounded audit did not establish overall security clearance. Refresh all current facts before choosing remediation.\\n\\nThe workflow update was subsequently merged (Trail 271); passing native or CI checks did not resolve this advisory. The separate macOS CGO Git-fixture failure recovered on one unchanged-commit diagnostic repeat and has no established causal connection to this concern.\\n\\nBounded acceptance:\\n\\n* Resolve the currently used v7 tag to its exact upstream commit and verify release/provenance.\\n* Check current authoritative GitHub/OSV advisory status and actual shipped runtime package versions, excluding dev-only inventory.\\n* Assess the relevant workflow input, credential and dataflow exposure without assuming that contents:read, lack of product-runtime shipping, or advisory counts alone prove safety/exploitability.\\n* If affected, propose an unambiguously compatible official patched release or another evidence-supported remediation through a separate reviewed slice. Do not rewrite upstream bundles or alter admin/security policy, historical receipts or production benchmark pins.\\n* Record explicit evidence-backed disposition; do not inherit a security clearance from successful CI.\\n\\nSources: [https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>) and [https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>). Related merged Trail: [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271>). No implementation is started by this issue.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2145/assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow-exposure\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2145-assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:27:49.124Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-19T01:26:07.092Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-19T01:26:07.072Z\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:53:21.990Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Done\",\"statusType\":\"completed\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"ecfbc412-4c03-49ea-9f2e-2eb3013bd153\",\"title\":\"fix(security): pin setup-go to fixed parser bundle\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/404\"},{\"id\":\"5c86a822-8ef3-49ad-bba6-9c82e2b3bd21\",\"title\":\"Authoritative XML-parser advisory\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q\"},{\"id\":\"87173ad1-2079-4955-87e5-64d445819dee\",\"title\":\"Merged setup-go workflow update — Trail 271\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}],"details":{"mode":"call","mcpResult":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2145\",\"uuid\":\"dd6fe94b-6ae8-46b6-afd1-43bfa0085e5f\",\"title\":\"Assess setup-go v7 bundled XML-parser advisory and workflow exposure\",\"description\":\"Retain the unresolved security concern separately from completed mechanical conflict repair and recovered main CI.\\n\\nThe prior exact-target review observed actions/setup-go v7.0.0 / v7 at b7ad1dad31e06c5925ef5d2fc7ad053ef454303e with fast-xml-parser 5.9.3 in its upstream runtime inventory and bundle. GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q was active HIGH, affecting >=5.9.3,<5.10.1 with fix at 5.10.1. Presence in the bundle is not proof of attacker-controlled workflow reachability. The broader bounded audit did not establish overall security clearance. Refresh all current facts before choosing remediation.\\n\\nThe workflow update was subsequently merged (Trail 271); passing native or CI checks did not resolve this advisory. The separate macOS CGO Git-fixture failure recovered on one unchanged-commit diagnostic repeat and has no established causal connection to this concern.\\n\\nBounded acceptance:\\n\\n* Resolve the currently used v7 tag to its exact upstream commit and verify release/provenance.\\n* Check current authoritative GitHub/OSV advisory status and actual shipped runtime package versions, excluding dev-only inventory.\\n* Assess the relevant workflow input, credential and dataflow exposure without assuming that contents:read, lack of product-runtime shipping, or advisory counts alone prove safety/exploitability.\\n* If affected, propose an unambiguously compatible official patched release or another evidence-supported remediation through a separate reviewed slice. Do not rewrite upstream bundles or alter admin/security policy, historical receipts or production benchmark pins.\\n* Record explicit evidence-backed disposition; do not inherit a security clearance from successful CI.\\n\\nSources: [https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>) and [https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q](<https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q>). Related merged Trail: [https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271](<https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271>). No implementation is started by this issue.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2145/assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow-exposure\",\"gitBranchName\":\"alex/cor-2145-assess-setup-go-v7-bundled-xml-parser-advisory-and-workflow\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-16T00:27:49.124Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-19T01:26:07.092Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-19T01:26:07.072Z\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-18T21:53:21.990Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Done\",\"statusType\":\"completed\",\"labels\":[\"Security\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"ecfbc412-4c03-49ea-9f2e-2eb3013bd153\",\"title\":\"fix(security): pin setup-go to fixed parser bundle\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/404\"},{\"id\":\"5c86a822-8ef3-49ad-bba6-9c82e2b3bd21\",\"title\":\"Authoritative XML-parser advisory\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8r6m-32jq-jx6q\"},{\"id\":\"87173ad1-2079-4955-87e5-64d445819dee\",\"title\":\"Merged setup-go workflow update — Trail 271\",\"subtitle\":\"Entire is a fast, distributed, Git-compatible network for mirroring GitHub repositories so agents can clone fast without hitting origin rate limits.\",\"url\":\"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/271\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Alex Ong\",\"createdById\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"assignee\":\"Alex Ong\",\"assigneeId\":\"45a00cf6-3a37-45ab-a508-d9da7f9d514c\",\"project\":\"P0 · GA the Local Brain\",\"projectId\":\"91954c69-3fab-4281-84e0-cf4b81d85d75\",\"team\":\"Core\",\"teamId\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\"}"}]},"server":"linear","tool":"save_issue"},"isError":false,"durationMs":3840,"timestamp":1792373168420}}
